// Rule-based plan, one slot per hour, from now until the last known price:
//   charge  - inside a charge window: TargetSoc = targetSoc, Strategy 2 (PROBATTERY)
//             -> GX charges from grid at up to BatteryChargeLimit (tb_max)
//   self    - price > charge price / roundTripEfficiency + b_cycle_cost:
